{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06087","headline":"河南严尹弟见宿弊庐访别人赋十韵 · 王维","name":"河南严尹弟见宿弊庐访别人赋十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上客能论道，吾生学养蒙。\n贫交世情外，才子古人中。\n冠上方簪豸，车边已画熊。\n拂衣迎五马，垂手凭双童。\n花醥和松屑，茶香透竹丛。\n薄霜澄夜月，残雪带春风。\n古壁苍苔黑，寒山远烧红。\n眼看东候别，心事北川同。\n爲学轻先辈，何能访老翁。\n欲知今日後，不乐爲车公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}